---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="角色档案 · 隔离检查">
  <h1>角色档案 · 隔离检查</h1>
  <p class="notice">选择角色文件，查看档案与备份。</p>
  <p><a href="/character/">返回角色</a></p>
  <label for="archive-file">选择本地角色文件（最多 2 MB）</label>
  <input id="archive-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" />
  <p>文件只在此浏览器中读取，不上传到服务器。完整档案、公开摘要和创建草稿是不同格式；公开摘要不能恢复内部记录。</p>
  <p id="archive-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未选择文件。</p>
  <button id="archive-original" type="button" disabled>下载原字节副本</button>
  <button id="archive-preserve" type="button" disabled>保全原件到浏览器隔离区</button>
  <div><select id="archive-saved" aria-label="已保全原件"><option value="">选择已保全原件</option></select> <button id="archive-load" type="button">读取原件</button></div>
  
  <h2>检查结果</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">位置</th><th scope="col">说明</th></tr></thead><tbody id="archive-diagnostics"></tbody></table></div>
  <details><summary>为什么有些旧值仍需确认？</summary></details>
  <noscript>请启用 JavaScript 以检查文件。</noscript>
  <script>import {startArchiveImport} from '../../../character/ui/import-controller';startArchiveImport();</script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>button,input{font:inherit;max-width:100%}button{min-height:44px;margin:.5rem 0}#archive-status{padding:.6rem;background:#f4f1eb}.table-wrap :global(td){overflow-wrap:anywhere}details{margin:1rem 0}</style>
